OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order add police chief to
OL,4,Acourt challenge of Drumcree parade ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Orange Order challenge to a decision
OL,7,Fto ban the Drumcree parade has been
OL,8,Fdelayed after Northern Ireland's police
OL,9,Fchief Jon Boutcher was added to the
OL,10,Fcase.
OL,12,FThe Portadown Orangemen want to
OL,13,Foverturn the Secretary of State's
OL,14,Fintervention on Friday night, which
OL,15,Fcame after he received advice from the
OL,16,Fchief constable.
OL,18,FBoutcher had advised Sir Chris Bryant
OL,19,Fthat the parade could have caused
OL,20,Fserious disorder, with "catastrophic"
OL,21,Fconsequences for Stormont and the peace
OL,22,Fprocess.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
