OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order add police chief to
OL,4,Acourt challenge of Drumcree parade ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Belfast's High Court heard
OL,7,Fthat the case is now being brought
OL,8,Fagainst both Boutcher and Sir Chris.
